Implement Offline Support

**Problem:** App fails without network

**Solution:**

```typescript
// hooks/useOfflineSync.ts
export const useOfflineSync = () => {
  const [isOnline, setIsOnline] = useState(navigator.onLine)
  const [pendingActions, setPendingActions] = useState<Action[]>([])

  useEffect(() => {
    if (isOnline) {
      syncPendingActions(pendingActions)
    }
  }, [isOnline])

  return { isOnline, queueAction }
}
```

Implement Event Sourcing for Timer

**Problem:** Timer state can get out of sync

**Solution:**

```typescript
// services/timerEventStore.ts
export class TimerEventStore {
  private events: TimerEvent[] = []

  record(event: TimerEvent) {
    this.events.push(event)
    this.broadcast(event)
  }

  replay(): TimerState {
    // Rebuild state from events
    // Enables time-travel debugging
  }
}
```

Add GraphQL API Option

**Problem:** REST API requires multiple requests for related data

**Solution:**

```typescript
// app/api/graphql/route.ts
import { createYoga } from 'graphql-yoga'

const yoga = createYoga({
  schema: {
    typeDefs: `
      type Query {
        currentWorkout: Workout
        spotifyStatus: SpotifyStatus
        heartRateData: [HRData]
      }
    `,
    resolvers: {
      /* ... */
    },
  },
})

// Single request for all data
```

Add Bundle Analysis

**Problem:** Unknown bundle composition

**Solution:**

```javascript
// next.config.js
const withBundleAnalyzer = require('@next/bundle-analyzer')({
  enabled: process.env.ANALYZE === 'true',
})

module.exports = withBundleAnalyzer(nextConfig)

// Run: ANALYZE=true npm run build
```

Implement Semantic Versioning

**Problem:** No version tracking

**Solution:**

```json
// package.json
{
  "scripts": {
    "release": "standard-version"
  }
}

// Auto-generates CHANGELOG.md
// Updates version numbers
// Creates git tags
```

